Lab 4: Developing Custom Processors in Camel
Objectives
Understand the role of custom processors in Apache Camel
Implement a custom processor class for routing and mediation
Integrate custom processors into Camel routes using the .process() method
Apply custom processors for data enrichment and validation tasks
Prerequisites
Java JDK 11 or later installed
Apache Camel 3.x (we'll use Camel 3.20.0 in this lab)
Maven 3.6+ for dependency management
Basic understanding of Java and Camel routes
IDE of your choice (VS Code, Eclipse, or IntelliJ)
Setup Instructions
Create a new Maven project:
mvn archetype:generate -DgroupId=com.example -DartifactId=camel-custom-processor -DarchetypeArtifactId=maven-archetype-quickstart -DinteractiveMode=false
Add Camel dependencies to your pom.xml:
<dependencies>
